        {
          "no": 1,
          "en": "PROBLEM",
          "title": "抽油机井工况诊断业务背景",
          "html": "<p>示功图记录光杆载荷随位移的闭合轨迹，是有杆泵工况复核的重要入口。形状压缩成面积与上下半程载荷等特征后，可以用少量可解释模板先筛出异常。本例对三类理想化教学形态做最近质心分类，同时展示当前卡片和特征空间中的邻近关系。</p><figure class=\"figure\"><div style=\"overflow-x:auto\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"当前教学示功图，窄屏横向滚动\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 335\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"当前教学示功图\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;min-width:620px;max-width:860px;margin:auto\"><title>当前教学示功图</title><rect width=\"720\" height=\"335\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#f6f9f8\"/><g font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#334741\"><path d=\"M75 265H665\" stroke=\"#d8e1df\"/><text x=\"65\" y=\"270\" text-anchor=\"end\">-4.54</text><text x=\"75\" y=\"291\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><path d=\"M75 211.25H665\" stroke=\"#d8e1df\"/><text x=\"65\" y=\"216.25\" text-anchor=\"end\">11.93</text><text x=\"222.5\" y=\"291\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0.75</text><path d=\"M75 157.5H665\" stroke=\"#d8e1df\"/><text x=\"65\" y=\"162.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">28.39</text><text x=\"370\" y=\"291\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1.5</text><path d=\"M75 103.75000000000003H665\" stroke=\"#d8e1df\"/><text x=\"65\" y=\"108.75000000000003\" text-anchor=\"end\">44.86</text><text x=\"517.5\" y=\"291\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2.25</text><path d=\"M75 50H665\" stroke=\"#d8e1df\"/><text x=\"65\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"end\">61.33</text><text x=\"665\" y=\"291\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3</text><polyline fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#267d70\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" points=\"75,151.41931656966239 76.4205056317019,145.0223994916294 80.66834228104702,150.73399327240136 87.7026009589984,141.87209098968174 97.45553790917042,143.49840045350248 109.83322701723526,143.77892034179723 124.71646437074915,135.4453372692641 141.96191625799258,127.59423640972443 161.40349954996844,124.19784242257938 182.85398117172457,123.76376590988173 206.1067812592173,108.9068056744236 230.93796263633064,108.65207771986209 257.10838745229853,105.6926608963816 284.3660202099336,95.67584451156